  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他在祈禱，他好像是向天祈禱。",
      "output_sha256": "cf4d9537580e33c93ba719dd4d6f828be302359119af3c32a0154d59807c94d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "cf4d9537580e33c93ba719dd4d6f828be302359119af3c32a0154d59807c94d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他跪在欄杆旁，冰冷的石板鋪成的步道上。",
      "output_sha256": "61d904e7ec13fe98a65e6dfdfbb5deaaf3060d8998a83746d82df2cd9cc7ffb8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.556725,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "99f10472798da046a9b509c2f037eb422b6aba8d12277943cb9c990db977d6f6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "61d904e7ec13fe98a65e6dfdfbb5deaaf3060d8998a83746d82df2cd9cc7ffb8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "然而他沒有鞋子，並且他用裸露的膝頭去接觸一些個冬天的石塊。",
      "output_sha256": "64b83feb6a3fbcfbd01f380f3a3e5e7da1f86d009b69399fb706415e2ae80e79",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "64b83feb6a3fbcfbd01f380f3a3e5e7da1f86d009b69399fb706415e2ae80e79",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "儘管還未走近他，我的心已因憤怒而燒得通紅，幾乎要炸裂！",
      "output_sha256": "fa10bc14fedf010afd9f7b8d558eb1631dee91ffa688c6dab5acab36b4b79f7e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.541346,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0970f34d9c01ce7b3142fcacf17c309f4d00777ad050444d29268828160a7418"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fa10bc14fedf010afd9f7b8d558eb1631dee91ffa688c6dab5acab36b4b79f7e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我咬我的嘴脣，畢竟我是沒有押起眼睛來走過他。",
      "output_sha256": "11156fd4bd5bfdd232f3436d20126e0aefa0113063fa429b548d13dae4b5bdb8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "11156fd4bd5bfdd232f3436d20126e0aefa0113063fa429b548d13dae4b5bdb8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他年紀已大，耳聾得幾乎無法聽見，眼睛似乎也已經腐爛。",
      "output_sha256": "2de7a30021f6f08f23e63cfbf99804e99d408ca30512534bec2980c35b80a081",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.369493,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e7ea2185f538dd2f11027482cfe1c26fda55a38909daf58634a29a0a3bf869e6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2de7a30021f6f08f23e63cfbf99804e99d408ca30512534bec2980c35b80a081",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "街上的寒風刺骨，吹得他的手如同一具無生氣的物體。",
      "output_sha256": "7d9f2c86afc632424d84ce6c836feca7d5c4f4a97864fda4e7ed150339e8d09c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.381143,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a5467dfe4fb23fc8d14a7e8bdd4fc61fb848e192363a0e4a5ef0f580f352bf99"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7d9f2c86afc632424d84ce6c836feca7d5c4f4a97864fda4e7ed150339e8d09c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是風，仍然是銳利的。",
      "output_sha256": "ab43edaa10886ed69e173654d3634c2d878308a354fde27f834224dad8c91d66",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "ab43edaa10886ed69e173654d3634c2d878308a354fde27f834224dad8c91d66",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我靠近他，卻無法聽到他祈禱的內容，只是低聲喃喃。",
      "output_sha256": "d26fc1e844eb4506b5d67d17a43826329d09beef1e9204030f20b028879cbd64",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.533436,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "88122dc6241762d7ff8666542bf00d09da10ed10f8ab4cafa58eded141e01e9f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d26fc1e844eb4506b5d67d17a43826329d09beef1e9204030f20b028879cbd64",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一位俄國老婦，語言似乎不是俄語，大概是猶太人，將一張小票子放進了老人的手中，他依然低聲祈禱，像是在向天呼喊。",
      "output_sha256": "c6c77a8aa9c6fb25cf5340d7696ee09bfadddd883c1c3296ffa34012ed907841",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.613089,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3eac4a4bcd72fc04ad8e746f0802fd99215eab5e3afa146adf8942fcaf84aeb5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c6c77a8aa9c6fb25cf5340d7696ee09bfadddd883c1c3296ffa34012ed907841",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我帶着我重得和石頭似的心走回屋中，把積下的舊報紙取出來，放到老人的面前，爲的是他可以賣幾個錢，但是當我已經把報紙放好的時候，我心起了一個劇變，我認爲我是最庸俗沒有的人了！",
      "output_sha256": "31c9908380fbafefe29e4b6637d667427e0737354525600e2a87eb9bfbf35c09",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "31c9908380fbafefe29e4b6637d667427e0737354525600e2a87eb9bfbf35c09",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "彷彿我是做了一件蠢事般的。",
      "output_sha256": "790fb094c5d6242967214629109a5d64a82fd3b06d1bd37b409110908c2021ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "790fb094c5d6242967214629109a5d64a82fd3b06d1bd37b409110908c2021ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "於是我摸衣袋，我思考家中存錢的盒子，可是連半角錢的票子都不能夠尋找得到。",
      "output_sha256": "7847517e605ec370934c409fe02bf74e8f0dd546b8b8b42a872489224a1d47fc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "7847517e605ec370934c409fe02bf74e8f0dd546b8b8b42a872489224a1d47fc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "老人似乎太笨了，或許他根本不懂得如何賣舊報紙。",
      "output_sha256": "a67f1f8b21cabf9aea9f0f457044fb1d7b74ec03c05de8a575d2ff911dd0744e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.494048,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f6634635635707c6af52029e37daa6e5236035b3b11951455b356e5c990886f2",
        "82a562b90f6a4ac88418ecc077e1c21b932b54900ed87172e5de194a07785e4f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a67f1f8b21cabf9aea9f0f457044fb1d7b74ec03c05de8a575d2ff911dd0744e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我走向鄰居家去，她的小孩子在牀上玩着，她常常是沒有心思向我講一些話。",
      "output_sha256": "c82ea27ec197ed0d8843de84047686c4d74fec85d7b922b9e80ddd16886215f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "c82ea27ec197ed0d8843de84047686c4d74fec85d7b922b9e80ddd16886215f2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我坐下來，把我帶去的包袱打開，預備裁一件衣服。",
      "output_sha256": "2fa77f5f6eef7e8d8e8e7bb04b0d0c3e7b6178e263e2d1d9316ba0412624ba18",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "2fa77f5f6eef7e8d8e8e7bb04b0d0c3e7b6178e263e2d1d9316ba0412624ba18",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而這一天，雪琦卻開始說話：",
      "output_sha256": "b76f7e362814f5fec8bd8f657153a23708fa4429fab61217ba841feb403917cb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.445536,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "572f3dd63ee83be3cffe9dabc8ae8bfdcd3069b7e830c457bd407a019ff654a0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b76f7e362814f5fec8bd8f657153a23708fa4429fab61217ba841feb403917cb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“於媽還不來，那麼，我的孩子會使我沒有希望。",
      "output_sha256": "1e81bdd71dc2bba477ca08b2590fdaa651c1ecf89b74e8215a78a81fd0badfb1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "1e81bdd71dc2bba477ca08b2590fdaa651c1ecf89b74e8215a78a81fd0badfb1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你看我是什麼事也沒有做，外國語不能讀，而且我連讀報的趣味都沒有呀！”",
      "output_sha256": "16df55006b6976dfa63035f5bd342afe3b29ddd895d75007eac0385a9adc29da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "16df55006b6976dfa63035f5bd342afe3b29ddd895d75007eac0385a9adc29da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“我想你還是另尋一個老媽子好啦！”",
      "output_sha256": "5927153a21d4e025f2d3adcbad5eb42a16cc0696895abc0e39420fd49e2348ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "5927153a21d4e025f2d3adcbad5eb42a16cc0696895abc0e39420fd49e2348ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“我也這樣想，不過實際是困難的。”",
      "output_sha256": "18a66182546dc821cec4b2383bd3564b174e8c037a961bae763bddb8beb9c893",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "18a66182546dc821cec4b2383bd3564b174e8c037a961bae763bddb8beb9c893",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "自從她生下孩子已經五個月，她每天都陷入苦惱，唇色暗淡，臉龐布滿皺紋。",
      "output_sha256": "01805cc703f5418a77858926b2377365d6d57606f33c0f86f30bcd892e9c9b89",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.402291,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "87318934a71d642798c3d4db334db44d60a9bcfd7f5577ac306c099a6b4892d5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "01805cc703f5418a77858926b2377365d6d57606f33c0f86f30bcd892e9c9b89",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "爲着我到她家去替她看小孩，她走了，和貓一樣躡手躡腳地下樓去了。",
      "output_sha256": "63266a0ab83db2613a433454758eeb5627e0803fd0317a296d802adea94f8fe6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "63266a0ab83db2613a433454758eeb5627e0803fd0317a296d802adea94f8fe6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "小孩子自己在牀上玩得厭了，幾次想要哭鬧，我忙着裁旗袍，只是用聲音招呼他。",
      "output_sha256": "fc1e1d428e8e4e5a98b6ff9dd9705bc79fa0a572bd77eed4fdecd8538fb5dc0f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc1e1d428e8e4e5a98b6ff9dd9705bc79fa0a572bd77eed4fdecd8538fb5dc0f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "看一下時鐘，知道她去了還不到一點鐘，可是看小孩子要多麼耐性呀！",
      "output_sha256": "3da7bb964a624807995453a76242fbdd9e6ba9806c1ca8ed37fa91a973ff6894",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "3da7bb964a624807995453a76242fbdd9e6ba9806c1ca8ed37fa91a973ff6894",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我煩亂着，這僅是一點鐘。",
      "output_sha256": "8677536736ce820a4971e920b10f32370232fe12512fa663df6d87e307765333",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "8677536736ce820a4971e920b10f32370232fe12512fa663df6d87e307765333",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "媽媽回來了，帶進來衣服的冷氣，後面跟進來一個瓷人樣的，纏着兩隻小腳，穿着毛邊鞋子，她坐在牀沿，並且在她進房的時候，她還向我行了一個深深的鞠躬禮，我又看見她戴的是毛邊帽子，她坐在牀沿。",
      "output_sha256": "2dcfa31c6b01a3af698117ea2e0632ec842bf0b51425257d637f3c88ebf1f583",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "2dcfa31c6b01a3af698117ea2e0632ec842bf0b51425257d637f3c88ebf1f583",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "過了一會，她是欣喜的，有點不像瓷人：“我是沒有做過老媽子的，我的男人在十八道街開柳條包鋪，帶開藥鋪……我實在不能再和他生氣，誰都是願意支使人，還有人願意給人家支使嗎？",
      "output_sha256": "576efeb16929fa918a2199cd9a05ea5d9c284ff43b8465f53f5bcea917d1a240",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "576efeb16929fa918a2199cd9a05ea5d9c284ff43b8465f53f5bcea917d1a240",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我們的命運不好，這是無法改變的！”",
      "output_sha256": "b332489df71f7568ceccb87c8ddea026617bd19dc764e9a446be49a0b73f9a55",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.332143,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6482d9391137b64417940452635e94e19f86152ec884c5bd8941be7ce1c8173f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b332489df71f7568ceccb87c8ddea026617bd19dc764e9a446be49a0b73f9a55",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "像猜謎似的，使人想不出她是什麼命運。",
      "output_sha256": "969b1ea09648ae455f6c5f4530e2b83f5bc86e61c6bde7a2e45dd1f517ba7a22",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "969b1ea09648ae455f6c5f4530e2b83f5bc86e61c6bde7a2e45dd1f517ba7a22",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "雪琦她歡喜，她想幸福是近着她了，她在感謝我：",
      "output_sha256": "63cb0066dc9c8833f57564c5f8574e35d9db8af5b1f7a8ed3b02f32105469d8c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "63cb0066dc9c8833f57564c5f8574e35d9db8af5b1f7a8ed3b02f32105469d8c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“玉瑩，你看，今天你若不來，我怎能去找這個老媽子來呀！”",
      "output_sha256": "27c2498b4ac70ef4d21eafc615411832e885ca6a7af36c3e3a01b7c265be9e73",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "27c2498b4ac70ef4d21eafc615411832e885ca6a7af36c3e3a01b7c265be9e73",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那個半老的婆娘仍然講着：“我的男人他打我罵我，以先對我很好，因爲他開柳條包鋪，要招股東。",
      "output_sha256": "8652456e1a0fcb1285d003b106298806a41e9167c0412593e2baa0e202c4c235",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "8652456e1a0fcb1285d003b106298806a41e9167c0412593e2baa0e202c4c235",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "就是那個入二十元錢頂大的股東，他替我造謠，說我孃家有錢，爲什麼不幫助開柳條鋪呢？",
      "output_sha256": "4978e95a6dbafed781fd9c067063570f0be25a08762fab98be40c0c0f424b6c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "4978e95a6dbafed781fd9c067063570f0be25a08762fab98be40c0c0f424b6c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在這一年中，就連一頓舒服飯也沒吃過，我能不傷心嗎！",
      "output_sha256": "ec874f96e9fcaca79503e5fe43b821d5f36d4b69b0afa010a2138b8a7b68e9b6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "ec874f96e9fcaca79503e5fe43b821d5f36d4b69b0afa010a2138b8a7b68e9b6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我十七歲嫁人，今年才二十四歲。",
      "output_sha256": "e423b0a2eab64057f9a25a3480c68c87a692916f13ec03c5ff9cf36e0908be98",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.660714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "58b913bee87fac3be8b020070ea5b52d4b8835c09c6f866602568fb3e3afdcb4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e423b0a2eab64057f9a25a3480c68c87a692916f13ec03c5ff9cf36e0908be98",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他從不和我吵鬧過。”",
      "output_sha256": "6119f27b1b249f08692cc143c12748d9d94929f3b87acf000bcc7c3e7c8c3e69",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "6119f27b1b249f08692cc143c12748d9d94929f3b87acf000bcc7c3e7c8c3e69",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "她其實並非半老的婦人，只有二十四歲。",
      "output_sha256": "7d78c09f049c24d431447050e6f4ca94244e694b3fa8dc52cbd5dfbf32445676",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.507258,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cbd69da64741082b226c6125a2734228a3b0e7bc9038e6dcbe9b64d54e6ef71f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7d78c09f049c24d431447050e6f4ca94244e694b3fa8dc52cbd5dfbf32445676",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "說到這樣傷心的地方，她沒有哭，她曉得做老媽子的身份。",
      "output_sha256": "6882703ee31bb0763b9b879b226010c12fd1826dfbbf12f2446f13091ffb17f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "6882703ee31bb0763b9b879b226010c12fd1826dfbbf12f2446f13091ffb17f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是又想說下去，雪琦眉毛打鎖，把小孩子給她：",
      "output_sha256": "a4ee560caac0af6f70eeb2ac65e45b41f3b48ff553304c5be56917a973bc744c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "a4ee560caac0af6f70eeb2ac65e45b41f3b48ff553304c5be56917a973bc744c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“你抱他試試。”",
      "output_sha256": "226e6e9ae28759ae627cb936320aea65e6a7b574c3340e9ff05b12663c92c6b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "226e6e9ae28759ae627cb936320aea65e6a7b574c3340e9ff05b12663c92c6b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "小孩子，不知爲什麼，但是他哭，也許他不願看那種可憐的臉相？",
      "output_sha256": "d06e3b81208ea62581ae281c6caf5cf6ac890cb42de60fd310698af019a64d8b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "d06e3b81208ea62581ae281c6caf5cf6ac890cb42de60fd310698af019a64d8b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "雪琦有些不快樂了，只是一刻的工夫，她覺得幸福是遠着她了！",
      "output_sha256": "616739fa9bfd61db96b00af0af9d5a2a01d97da9641eff94aed9e26d504c07be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "616739fa9bfd61db96b00af0af9d5a2a01d97da9641eff94aed9e26d504c07be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "過了一會，她又像個瓷人，最像瓷人的部分，就是她的眼睛，眼珠定住。",
      "output_sha256": "130f358c7dab50817d795280abc6d1d88a15cb5b22b48ae83dba13adbadb9fe8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "130f358c7dab50817d795280abc6d1d88a15cb5b22b48ae83dba13adbadb9fe8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我們一向她看去，她忙着把眼珠活動一下，然而很慢，並且一會又要定住。",
      "output_sha256": "3df866190f26ae183892261b6ea882d55d28ca7633caaa8b6115b3cc4415371b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "3df866190f26ae183892261b6ea882d55d28ca7633caaa8b6115b3cc4415371b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“你別想，未來會有美好的一天……”",
      "output_sha256": "6e033518d348885de9b020b8cb1c6e04f039dd9ddf1062a7232435811027a89e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.542615,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fcfa06a17d6c849cd85ee80a67f91974dae2735b1e2da8a165f51fe9a3bd3b95"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6e033518d348885de9b020b8cb1c6e04f039dd9ddf1062a7232435811027a89e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“我是同他打架生氣的，一生氣就和個呆人樣，什麼也不能做。”",
      "output_sha256": "b7acdb1b57d0e16540196f99b12407eb1f8488da3e142fd67fee1dadc37f713e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "b7acdb1b57d0e16540196f99b12407eb1f8488da3e142fd67fee1dadc37f713e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那瓷人又忙着補充一句：“若不生氣，什麼病也沒有呀！",
      "output_sha256": "143ab385e7adaf3b0f0229358381fa050578bcd2697071e5328267e909811e6f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "143ab385e7adaf3b0f0229358381fa050578bcd2697071e5328267e909811e6f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "好人也是一樣。”",
      "output_sha256": "0a3f6be33b6553dfff2df6cd9519489f01152db11a0a63ffea222d0edb399625",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.517857,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "46eb9d47527b2bc484ce4b4ddbd16705ec5361a52dfb0d19891a55bbdf44774d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0a3f6be33b6553dfff2df6cd9519489f01152db11a0a63ffea222d0edb399625",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "後來她看我縫衣裳，她來幫助我，我不願她來幫助，但是她要來幫助。",
      "output_sha256": "d83358a13bfc6df2f15826587fa3b6f8685eee0ba706218a549899f247c528d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "d83358a13bfc6df2f15826587fa3b6f8685eee0ba706218a549899f247c528d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "小孩在媽媽的懷裡喝著奶，睡著了。",
      "output_sha256": "9eff3f2559d8fbe8682e9e32ee5077c29fcb983961e010ed178817c850a75351",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.585714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3d4f0099f8ce6bab5f14619d4018c14a8453ccb1fd194d92e6eb474f2fd8a871"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9eff3f2559d8fbe8682e9e32ee5077c29fcb983961e010ed178817c850a75351",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "孩子對所有聲音都感到害怕，我們的呼吸為了不驚擾他而變得清晰可聞。",
      "output_sha256": "435bae4995c6e4230f2988f5e34950d039702f99aed2e0e0f6a689a39712b353",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.391667,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e2a55e4ba0b926381a13361bcd40c111546430fa1e037a136cd4fb004f464909"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "435bae4995c6e4230f2988f5e34950d039702f99aed2e0e0f6a689a39712b353",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "雪琦的心情越發不佳。",
      "output_sha256": "f97ec0a7778ea59f96ab06d208079595d11b8abb89c0dd005e4c16e9e24dad58",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.372382,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7d7da081bb3a195a81e20fee3c4b59012aa3e170e1b21bed39d64cc1ba42a751"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f97ec0a7778ea59f96ab06d208079595d11b8abb89c0dd005e4c16e9e24dad58",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "或許她在擔憂，衡量著自己的計劃如何失敗。",
      "output_sha256": "7116e88e08525e6aa0715e0aea7be082b6c903127200d92ebad7106c95920523",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.406136,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "92234fc32cf6a8416a6c32a03f54facaa57a9ddd6e15ed3c3960cf95f92ba226"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7116e88e08525e6aa0715e0aea7be082b6c903127200d92ebad7106c95920523",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我隱約察覺到這個瓷人會被辭退的隱憂。",
      "output_sha256": "dd228c154490fea6af2ca2428879855af54f8d5477e417330c736a360b2ea630",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.463919,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a39767379c0fcc745f08a3a7db8b1ceea327c214e9ea5cb543e7d9d5e795fc13"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dd228c154490fea6af2ca2428879855af54f8d5477e417330c736a360b2ea630",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "然而她是有希望的，滿有希望，她殷勤地在盆中給小孩在洗尿布。",
      "output_sha256": "570fce26d0246ff981d8cebe329ea3f3ecedbc4de41c677a2a116477d75e1d40",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "570fce26d0246ff981d8cebe329ea3f3ecedbc4de41c677a2a116477d75e1d40",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“我對當老媽子的規矩不太了解，太太要指教我。”",
      "output_sha256": "f473f29553cd9a457b1a5d16242f6f4124f19cbd4fc43aa53fe6bc7f129eaeaf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": 0.692514,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "27f4d92a723893aa8ec0841e8437ef794880a7a0d9f81cfd89b1d55d334e2ad8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f473f29553cd9a457b1a5d16242f6f4124f19cbd4fc43aa53fe6bc7f129eaeaf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "她說完坐在木凳上，又開始變成不動的瓷人。",
      "output_sha256": "b76bc703df0b5b5144f5f272276e883739d4107ce8de30a4c150d84ff03d164d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "b76bc703df0b5b5144f5f272276e883739d4107ce8de30a4c150d84ff03d164d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 30,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我煩擾着，街頭的老人又回到我的心中；雪琦鉛板樣的心沉沉地掛在臉上。",
      "output_sha256": "18aa941062b440cc6dac8254a96eb58cf2567dacc05a9c2fe404eb35228491da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "18aa941062b440cc6dac8254a96eb58cf2567dacc05a9c2fe404eb35228491da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“你把髒水倒進水池裡。”",
      "output_sha256": "4ee611bd2b137d01b296e4e3515ed9112b58a2e6e5953899fa98ee408ab27d79",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": 0.793947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7b2f61dadce8dac451e0a99f2affde88a1259ed5e479beb0c35c56304abfa0d7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4ee611bd2b137d01b296e4e3515ed9112b58a2e6e5953899fa98ee408ab27d79",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "她向擺在木凳間的那瓷人說。",
      "output_sha256": "6800e27c66bf343c05c3cadc5d78309e30f9d6f5b6cda2b60cd3adb65c075957",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "6800e27c66bf343c05c3cadc5d78309e30f9d6f5b6cda2b60cd3adb65c075957",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 32,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "捧着小盆子，那個婦人紫色毛邊鞋子還沒有響出門去，雪琦的眼睛和偷人樣轉過來了：",
      "output_sha256": "a57c6c922adefb78b083d24af54cb25ae0a767eaf1134dd5be43b4ad95e87433",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "a57c6c922adefb78b083d24af54cb25ae0a767eaf1134dd5be43b4ad95e87433",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“她是不是不行？",
      "output_sha256": "5585c96a8819b6a2426c5f9d9715d5a04172165d32fe07ce5e175ea7387becd8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "5585c96a8819b6a2426c5f9d9715d5a04172165d32fe07ce5e175ea7387becd8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那麼快讓她走吧！”",
      "output_sha256": "e7bd7e327b08ff0acf2fb06cb20882c5b96e2ce8dafc1a2a2bb1fd9dc62b9228",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "e7bd7e327b08ff0acf2fb06cb20882c5b96e2ce8dafc1a2a2bb1fd9dc62b9228",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 34,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "孩子被隨意地丟在床上，哭鬧不止，她到隔壁借了三角錢給老媽子的工資。",
      "output_sha256": "1c40c54c63168a68ce6f8bbed078c0bc16fc01458e979fb05115146ae447c71f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": 0.653724,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        66
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "df0285d02adeec307d5cb4b5b87e06164b79d9c512d5ee9488a088b58378e9b2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1c40c54c63168a68ce6f8bbed078c0bc16fc01458e979fb05115146ae447c71f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 35,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那雙紫色毛邊鞋慢慢移動，她倒了乾淨的水進盆架間，然後來招呼孩子。",
      "output_sha256": "711cbaf1a516c4d1d6905066c43d30137c9388a79e9bf0aa13f2590f866786a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": 0.633403,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        67
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "af358c5b86287aebde3b1333dbb754c4e313397d438d3724f91396cf73affd60"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_ai_sha256": "711cbaf1a516c4d1d6905066c43d30137c9388a79e9bf0aa13f2590f866786a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 35,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "孩子害怕這個瓷人，哭得更大聲。",
      "output_sha256": "fc49c014427c35df4850ccb3467d19043d249b06cde8b2e3d0b51eba010b96ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": 0.502759,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        68
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "becc269f4f9934f09112ab5e4c36c68a118dfb780cc41bed769258a174b8e010"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fc49c014427c35df4850ccb3467d19043d249b06cde8b2e3d0b51eba010b96ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        65
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 35,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我縫着衣服，不知怎麼一種不安傳染了我的心。",
      "output_sha256": "374001c9d05d3bb8378ee4c2bece4b5de8b4cfbdc870b3cf9b84897222aeb1f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 69,
      "source_human_sha256": "374001c9d05d3bb8378ee4c2bece4b5de8b4cfbdc870b3cf9b84897222aeb1f2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 36,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "忽然老媽子停下來，那是雪琦把三角錢的票子示到面前的時候，她拿到三角錢走了。",
      "output_sha256": "e54126976ab12662fd48dac866b6d5eeee4cd031b36798d938721ecd2aa7b012",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 70,
      "source_human_sha256": "e54126976ab12662fd48dac866b6d5eeee4cd031b36798d938721ecd2aa7b012",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 36,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "她又回到了那些最悲傷的家庭，去尋找她的可憐生活。",
      "output_sha256": "c4e5caf9a4e8c816589357e9c5b5bcadbd4e5c21e92042e3e6f28507526a3428",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": 0.561364,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        71
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "35ba82ee469f7242553a82ff428e4b066c5df7ab0aa76ce4c5a14158e3a98c02"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c4e5caf9a4e8c816589357e9c5b5bcadbd4e5c21e92042e3e6f28507526a3428",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        68
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 37,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "毛邊帽子，毛邊鞋子，來了又走了。",
      "output_sha256": "bdcfc99bc16880613b21820c6d8c61cecb93c08a4c0874d501aa10b138947eb9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_human_sha256": "bdcfc99bc16880613b21820c6d8c61cecb93c08a4c0874d501aa10b138947eb9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 38,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "雪琦仍然自己抱着孩子。",
      "output_sha256": "3c8528f8663b58c2fa554963191ac5348746ae3e20ed0b815c6bb9a6d07ffc96",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 73,
      "source_human_sha256": "3c8528f8663b58c2fa554963191ac5348746ae3e20ed0b815c6bb9a6d07ffc96",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 73,
      "paragraph_index": 39,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“你若不來，我怎能去找她來呢！”",
      "output_sha256": "e56ad24a849ef1084f76b129cc1bfc2a6f541d5c3dea1da95fc9758c7f8e71ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 69,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_human_sha256": "e56ad24a849ef1084f76b129cc1bfc2a6f541d5c3dea1da95fc9758c7f8e71ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 74,
      "paragraph_index": 39,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "她埋怨我。",
      "output_sha256": "a2b48fa4bbaebb9408a262f6d2a9c848aff8d30de645901519b2aec41bee6004",
      "alignment_unit_index": 70,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 75,
      "source_human_sha256": "a2b48fa4bbaebb9408a262f6d2a9c848aff8d30de645901519b2aec41bee6004",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 75,
      "paragraph_index": 40,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我們深深呼吸了一下，好像剛從暗室走出。",
      "output_sha256": "d897fdbadc87b7b0018cb603630e2a0d56c57e68c7248c75105e9634bc583280",
      "alignment_unit_index": 71,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 76,
      "source_human_sha256": "d897fdbadc87b7b0018cb603630e2a0d56c57e68c7248c75105e9634bc583280",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 76,
      "paragraph_index": 40,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "屋子漸漸沒有陽光了，我回家了，帶着我的包袱，包袱中好像裹着一羣麻煩的想頭——婦女們有可厭的丈夫，可厭的孩子。",
      "output_sha256": "eba7975db67514c3a09af43a5c8f3092bacebfa0d718385dd8a8c27772fbe2fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 72,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 77,
      "source_human_sha256": "eba7975db67514c3a09af43a5c8f3092bacebfa0d718385dd8a8c27772fbe2fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 77,
      "paragraph_index": 40,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "冬天追趕着叫化子使他絕望。",
      "output_sha256": "9638b14c13c516646effe076e79e664726ac8b7545bab164888fab1dd71e07c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 73,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 78,
      "source_human_sha256": "9638b14c13c516646effe076e79e664726ac8b7545bab164888fab1dd71e07c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 78,
      "paragraph_index": 41,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在家門口，依然是那條欄杆，但那塊石道上，老人跪著向天，黃昏降臨，他的絕望似乎比死亡更為沉重。",
      "output_sha256": "7f1f2a2e550e1186078c66d9abc7c0b06ce14c716720f3e0bfa6b994c50643a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 74,
      "alignment_score": 0.594446,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        79
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "21fad28adf8bb4881d99af68b471828ad973565ae5c135acbe8e59edacbfe6c3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 76,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7f1f2a2e550e1186078c66d9abc7c0b06ce14c716720f3e0bfa6b994c50643a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        76
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 79,
      "paragraph_index": 42,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我經過他，總無法聽清他祈禱的文句，但我知道他所求的，並不是我給他的報紙，也不是那半角錢的票子，而是希望能將他從死亡的邊緣拉回來。",
      "output_sha256": "6fa369e88bcdbd0801ed22f756a4c88075dc19a08981a944421ede6944188bfb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 75,
      "alignment_score": 0.679946,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        80
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "708fb9a972c313fe2440cc48c446bff12af168cc5cb31c3b799b187b72b5d0f5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 77,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6fa369e88bcdbd0801ed22f756a4c88075dc19a08981a944421ede6944188bfb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        77
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 80,
      "paragraph_index": 43,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "然而讓我怎樣做呢？",
      "output_sha256": "9d7b79ddc79249edac202900c299970d1ea6b25b070c864a7d28747dc35e0548",
      "alignment_unit_index": 76,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 81,
      "source_human_sha256": "9d7b79ddc79249edac202900c299970d1ea6b25b070c864a7d28747dc35e0548",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 81,
      "paragraph_index": 43,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他向天跪着，他向天祈禱……",
      "output_sha256": "00cf8969701dc70b58b17a591add23225bfab33cd7e2d86cec1dda0fa6ce29f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 77,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 82,
      "source_human_sha256": "00cf8969701dc70b58b17a591add23225bfab33cd7e2d86cec1dda0fa6ce29f2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
